OL,4,BEight-year ban for player who threw    
OL,5,Brock that hit assistant referee        
OL,6,GAn Ecuadorian footballer has been      
OL,7,Gbanned for eight years for throwing a  
OL,8,Grock at an assistant referee, leaving  
OL,9,Ghim requiring surgery to his face.     
OL,11,FJhon Perlaza was playing for Club      
OL,12,FCiudad de Yantzaza against Club Rio    
OL,13,FAguarico FC in a third-tier match in   
OL,14,FOctober when the incident took place.  
OL,16,FThe stone struck assistant referee     
OL,17,FLenin Giovanni Ojeda Nunez in the face 
OL,18,Fin the 96th minute of the game, which  
OL,19,Fwas subsequently abandoned.            
